{\b Aether 0.1}\par
\par
Aether is a plugin-driven code editor and IDE.\par
\par
This is a pre-release build provided as-is, without warranty of any kind. No license terms have been chosen for this project yet.\par
\par
Aether installs for the current Windows user only and does not need administrator rights. Your settings and plugins are stored in the .aether folder in your user profile and are kept when Aether is uninstalled.\par
